caption>這或就是當上公務員後的心路歷程！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"這或就是當上公務員後的心路歷程！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241210/943187654856544256892074.jpeg/6_mI4hH_s0h-2L33C_fqb7AJsIwKYm2Xa2QIYGtkCGA\"/><figcaption>這或就是當上公務員後的心路歷程！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"這或就是當上公務員後的心路歷程！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241210/943187656836386816893602.jpeg/DI1zkv6qI1-RqinQzH05WTR-_ZVy9Q33BIdtyQSHbck\"/><figcaption>這或就是當上公務員後的心路歷程！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"這或就是當上公務員後的心路歷程！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241210/943187658514239488042517.jpeg/4gDxZIZrjOCWy5aH-T3F42JvnpNAEH5HFrp3qha6d6o\"/><figcaption>這或就是當上公務員後的心路歷程！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"這或就是當上公務員後的心路歷程！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241210/943187660917706752530874.jpeg/Pm17SC4xHhefPIqCpDk_h-zUulliv55ov5rBF7-awRc\"/><figcaption>這或就是當上公務員後的心路歷程！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"這或就是當上公務員後的心路歷程！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241210/943187651555495936458039.jpeg/JQo9YayLAC_zbk0HCSeia0NiVq1Ibd89poQKv6aECr8\"/><figcaption>這或就是當上公務員後的心路歷程！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>下屬比主管薪水還要高 中央留用公職專業人員新制惹爭議</p><p>鐵飯碗變「生鏽碗」？他嘆基本薪資吃掉公職優勢：根本穩定窮</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-29T08:21:49.458457+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1911,"images":44,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}